    <item>
      <title>vbs 后台运行 bat</title>
      <link>/posts/vbs-run-bat/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jan 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/posts/vbs-run-bat/</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>假设有三个 bat 程序需要后台运行（称为 <code>A.bat</code>、<code>B.bat</code>、<code>C.bat</code>）：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="ln">1</span><span class="cl">Set ws = CreateObject(&#34;Wscript.Shell&#34;)
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">2</span><span class="cl">ws.run &#34;cmd /c A.bat&#34;,0
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">3</span><span class="cl">ws.run &#34;cmd /c B.bat&#34;,0
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">4</span><span class="cl">ws.run &#34;cmd /c C.bat&#34;,0
</span></span></code></pre></div>]]></description>
